✅ Step 3: Grammar Modification

**File Modified:**
```
wrangler-transform/src/main/antlr4/io/cdap/wrangler/grammar/Recipe.g4
```

**Change Made:**
- Modified the grammar to allow optional `;` at the end of every directive.

**Before:**
```antlr
recipe: directive (NEWLINE directive)* EOF;
```

**After:**
```antlr
recipe: directive (NEWLINE directive)* SEMICOLON? EOF;
```

